      => &join(scroll_model => shared read phase)
      => *remainder(nav_fit + menu_state_machine) %expect{ lines: under-600 ; mount: ~immediate }
  >>
  sequencing: `decompose AFTER phase 3. Extracting now would duplicate the write and observe paths this plan is consolidating — moving complexity sideways, which is exactly what runtime-module-decomposition warns against.`
 }

 #invariant: `A module mounted IMMEDIATE on every page should hold one concern. This holds nine.`
}[reg=facet]

